OL,3,GNEWSAGrant to save city's tallest
OL,4,Aparish church spire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed church has received a
OL,7,F#250,000 heritage grant which will be
OL,8,Fused to restore and protect its spire
OL,9,F"for generations to come", the Diocese
OL,10,Fof Sheffield has said.
OL,12,FSt John's Church in Ranmoor will use
OL,13,Fmoney from the National Lottery
OL,14,FHeritage Fund for "urgent" restoration
OL,15,Fwork after problems with the structure
OL,16,Fwere discovered a few years ago.
OL,18,FA total of #750,000 has already been
OL,19,Fraised by the community and through
OL,20,Fother grants.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
