OL,3,GNEWSAGrant to save city's tallest
OL,4,Aparish church spire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reverend Canon Dr Matthew Rhodes,
OL,7,Fthe vicar of St John's, said: "We're
OL,8,Fjust really grateful for the
OL,9,Fcommunity's support. Lots of people
OL,10,Fhave been getting behind this."
